    "searchText": "very long distance covalex delivery stanton covalex_deliverypilot_stanton_moldsampletreatmentorganimassbioplastic_rank2 covalex delivery standing courier pickup: stanton hiya,\n\ncovalex requires a safe pair of hands to pick up some packages and get them where they need to go.\n\ndesignating this a long distance delivery so stock up on fuel and supplies. and definitely make sure you bring a handheld tractor beam.\n\nas for what ship to bring, you'll also need something that can move [missionmaxscusize] cargo containers.\n\n[contractor]\n\nella tieno\njr. logistics coordinator\ncovalex shipping\n'anything you need, anywhere you need it.'\n\ncovalex shipping is a limited liability corporation. to encourage timely deliveries and prevent fraud on cargo hauls, covalex shipping will set a delivery time limit and upon expiration, any undelivered cargo will be considered stolen and treated as such. total payment will be prorated according to the percentage of cargo successfully delivered. 218c0738-484e-46d0-9d42-b7c699fdba6b 280f67b7-5481-4808-a4b2-0b4da60b2953 4730ca94-7b68-4fc2-9e76-0c2f994de2e9 4ddbedd1-f03d-4de3-8f19-566be8b9e60e 68537d94-d066-4626-9072-e9123f7b11b7 871c5b5c-5ede-4c42-9c99-9f19d5d3a33c b00f0e84-0c24-4a9c-984c-0145c7b2befb d835b60e-be11-4b06-8b11-5892b8bd1851 e27ba35e-8ef8-4bb0-b75d-27e0e5dc4446 e6aa24f9-fdfd-44ca-b7ba-4b74f4432eed ea8da32e-c36e-493a-ad7f-0dfc8511e7bc f09bf104-4e0d-4481-8006-3df0fae6d3ae f5606b80-6e0e-4bb4-8b68-e976748dd338 standing +150 120,750 auec completion tag 58,000 auec 82,250 auec 106,250 auec 145,000 auec 48,250 auec"
